ENTRY            D4442   20260528   20261124   20261124       D153
SUBENT        D4442001   20260528   20261124   20261124       D153
BIB                 12         23
TITLE      Experimental determination of the excitation functions
           of the alpha particle-induced nuclear reactions on
           rhodium up to 50 MeV
AUTHOR     (F.Ditroi,S.Takacs,H.Haba,M.Aikawa,H.Huang,Z.Tsoodol,
           K.Sugihara,S.Ebata,Z.Szucs,T.Tornyi)
INSTITUTE  (3HUNDEB,2JPNIPC,2JPNHOK,3MGLNUM,2JPNKEK,2JPNSUU)
REFERENCE  (J,EPJ/A,61,201,2025)
MONITOR    (22-TI-0(A,X)24-CR-51,,SIG)
INC-SOURCE Beam intensity: 200 nA.
SAMPLE     The stacked target consisted of 24 rhodium foils
            (25 and 6 um) and 21 titanium foils (6 um).
METHOD     (ACTIV) irradiated for 30 minutes
           (GSPEC)
FACILITY   (ISOCY,2JPNIPC) AVF
DETECTOR   (HPGE)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) total uncertainty
           (ERR-1) target thickness
           (ERR-2) beam intensity
           (ERR-3,0.5,10.0) gamma-ray intensity (0.5-10%)
           (ERR-4,3.0,6.0) detector efficiency (3-6%)
           (ERR-S,1.0,7.0) statistics (1-7%)
            (statistical uncertainties for complex peaks <15%)
HISTORY    (20260528C) TT
ENDBIB              23
COMMON               2          3
ERR-1      ERR-2
PER-CENT   PER-CENT
3.0        5.0
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT           30
